# README media: TINTAIL
shotscale 2
seed 16
game tintail
wait 60
shot tintail_title
cheat beaten 8
cheat best 1 3
cheat best 2 3
cheat best 3 2
cheat best 4 3
cheat best 5 3
cheat best 6 1
cheat best 7 3
cheat best 8 2
cheat map
wait 30
shot tintail_map
# three toads and a winding colour path
cheat level 4
wait 2
hold B
wait 30
shot tintail_danger
release B
gifstart tintail 4 2
wait 20
hold B
wait 40
release B
cheat autosolve
wait 460
gifstop
# the stork flats, halfway
cheat level 5
cheat autosolve
wait 200
hold B
wait 6
shot tintail_storks
release B
